# Build context for docker/Dockerfile (the cmo-import image), which builds from
# the repo root but only COPYs: docker/requirements.txt, docker/automation-environment.sh,
# a handful of import-scripts/*.sh, and dags/. Everything excluded below is dead
# context — keeping it out speeds builds and avoids cache-busting on unrelated edits.
#
# Only paths the Dockerfile actually COPYs must survive: import-scripts/, dags/, docker/.
# (docker/core.Dockerfile builds from a cbioportal-core checkout, so this file
# does not apply to it.)

# VCS / CI / repo meta
.git
.gitignore
.github
.circleci

# Pipeline subtrees unrelated to the import image
common/
crdb/
cvr/
ddp/
redcap/
integration-tests/
docs/

# Repo-root files not needed by the image
LICENSE
Makefile
README.md
pom.xml

# Docker planning/test docs (not needed inside the image)
docker/*.md

# Editor / OS / Python cruft
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
*.log
